Attributes type="symbol" name="Free_text" y=480 x=7680 orient="N0"
Property name="value" value="Assume the transistor DC SOA is just limited by the allowable power dissipation at our operating voltage\n\nTa = ambient temperature (°C)\nTc = transistor case temperature (°C)\nTj = transistor junction temperature (°C)\nRthjc  = thermal resistance junction to case (°C/W)\nRthca = thermal resistance case to ambient, ie heatsink (°C/W)\nPd = power dissipation (W)\n\nSteady State Equations\nTj = Ta + Pd × (Rthjc + Rthca)\nRthca = (Tj - Ta) ÷ Pd - Rthjc\nTc = Ta + Pd × Rthca\n\nData & calculation\nVsupply max = 16V\nIoutmax = 2.75A\nso Pd = 44W (but not allowing for any tolerances)\nTa allow 30°C\n\nTIP147\nSOA = 125W at Tc = 25°C\nTj allow 125°C (usual to allow a 25°C margin to absolute max)\nRthjc = 1°C/W\nso Rthca = (125 - 30) ÷ 44 - 1 = 1.16°C/W\nTc = 30 + 44 × 1.16 = 81°C\n\nSUP70060E\nSOA = 200W at Tc = 25°C\nTj allow 150°C (usual to allow a 25°C margin to absolute max)\nRthjc = 0.75°C/W\nso Rthca = (150 - 30) ÷ 44 - 0.75 = 1.98°C/W\nTc = 30 + 44 × 1.98 = 117°C\n\nSo the mosfet can have a smaller heatsink but at the expense of running hotter.\nThough it could have the same size heatsink as the darlington but run a cooler Tj" x=0 y=156 align="LeftBase" selectable=1 font="FreeText"
.EndInstance
--EndSXVERSION1.5
Text value=".simulator SIMETRIX\n.tran 20m\n.options reltol=10u\n\n\n**************************************\n*      Model Generated by MODPEX     *\n*Copyright(c) Symmetry Design Systems*\n*         All Rights Reserved        *\n*    UNPUBLISHED LICENSED SOFTWARE   *\n*   Contains Proprietary Information *\n*      Which is The Property of      *\n*     SYMMETRY OR ITS LICENSORS      *\n*    Modeling services provided by   *\n* Interface Technologies www.i-t.com *\n**************************************\n****PNP darlington****\n.SUBCKT tip147 1 2 3\n* Model generated on Feb  8, 2004\n* Model format: PSpice\n* Darlington macro model\n* External node designations\n* Node 1 -> Collect\n* Node 2 -> Base\n* Node 3 -> Emitter\nQ1 1 2 4 qmodel\nQ2 1 4 3 q1model 9.26065\nD1 1 3 dmodel\nR1 2 4 8000\nR2 4 3 40\n* Default values used in dmodel\n*   EG=1.11 TT=0 BV=infinite\n.MODEL dmodel d\n+IS=1e-12 RS=10 N=1 XTI=3\n+CJO=0 VJ=0.75 M=0.33 FC=0.5\n.MODEL qmodel pnp\n+IS=1.03024e-14 BF=257.093 NF=1.2 VAF=679.126\n+IKF=0.190032 ISE=1.23159e-13 NE=1.73997 BR=1.10206\n+NR=1.19838 VAR=126.182 IKR=0.103332 ISC=1.23159e-13\n+NC=2 RB=5.06065 IRB=0.2 RBM=5.06065\n+RE=0.199903 RC=2.01466 XTB=0.354371 XTI=3.01199 EG=1.206\n+CJE=1e-11 VJE=0.75 MJE=0.33 TF=1e-09\n+XTF=1 VTF=10 ITF=0.01 CJC=1.67157e-09\n+VJC=0.95 MJC=0.23 XCJC=0.9 FC=0.5\n+TR=1e-07 PTF=0 KF=0 AF=1\n.MODEL q1model pnp\n+IS=1.03024e-14 BF=257.093 NF=1.2 VAF=679.126\n+IKF=0.190032 ISE=1.23159e-13 NE=1.73997 BR=1.10206\n+NR=1.19838 VAR=126.182 IKR=0.103332 ISC=1.23159e-13\n+NC=2 RB=5.06065 IRB=0.2 RBM=5.06065\n+RE=0.199903 RC=2.01466 XTB=0.354371 XTI=3.01199 EG=1.206\n+CJE=1e-11 VJE=0.75 MJE=0.33 TF=1e-09\n+XTF=1 VTF=10 ITF=0.01 CJC=0\n+VJC=0.95 MJC=0.23 XCJC=0.9 FC=0.5\n+TR=1e-07 PTF=0 KF=0 AF=1\n.ENDS\n\n\n********************************\n* Copyright:                   *\n* Vishay Intertechnology, Inc. *\n********************************\n*Apr 11, 2016\n*ECN S16-0603, Rev. A\n*File Name: SUP70060E_PS.txt and SUP70060E_PS.lib\n*This document is intended as a SPICE modeling guideline and does not\n*constitute a commercial product datasheet. Designers should refer to the\n*appropriate datasheet of the same number for guaranteed specification\n*limits.\n****N-ch mosfet*****\n.SUBCKT SUP70060E D G S \nM1 3 GX S S NMOS W= 8251216u L= 0.30u \nM2 S GX S D PMOS W= 8251216u L= 0.26u \nR1 D 3 4.005e-03 TC=5.090e-03,1.281e-05\nCGS GX S 1.618e-09 \nCGD GX D 1.000e-13 \nRG G GY 1m \nRTCV 100 S 1e6 TC=3.2e-04,-2.111e-06\nETCV GX GY 100 200 1 \nITCV S 100 1u \nVTCV 200 S 1 \nDBD S D DBD 8251216u \n**************************************************************** \n.MODEL NMOS NMOS ( LEVEL = 3 TOX = 5e-8 \n+ RS = 0 KP = 8.117e-06 NSUB = 2.859e+17 \n+ KAPPA = 1.129e-02 NFS = 9.842e+11 \n+ LD = 0 IS = 0 TPG = 1    )\n*************************************************************** \n.MODEL PMOS PMOS ( LEVEL = 3 TOX = 5e-8 \n+NSUB = 1.005e+16 IS = 0 TPG = -1    )\n**************************************************************** \n.MODEL DBD D ( \n+FC = 0.1 TT = 9.640e-09 T_measured = 25 BV = 101\n+RS = 1.997e-02 N = 1.082e+00 IS = 1.509e-12 \n+EG = 1.218e+00 XTI = 7.055e-01 TRS1 = 3.172e-03\n+CJO = 4.870e-10 VJ = 1.980e+01 M = 9.211e-01 ) \n.ENDS \n\n\n.SUBCKT tip107 1 2 3\n**************************************\n*      Model Generated by MODPEX     *\n*Copyright(c) Symmetry Design Systems*\n*         All Rights Reserved        *\n*    UNPUBLISHED LICENSED SOFTWARE   *\n*   Contains Proprietary Information *\n*      Which is The Property of      *\n*     SYMMETRY OR ITS LICENSORS      *\n*Commercial Use or Resale Restricted *\n*   by Symmetry License Agreement    *\n**************************************\n* Model generated on Jan 20, 03\n* MODEL FORMAT: PSpice\n* Darlington macro model\n* External node designations\n* Node 1 -> Collect\n* Node 2 -> Base\n* Node 3 -> Emitter\nQ1 1 2 4 qmodel\nQ2 1 4 3 q1model 10.2983\nD1 1 3 dmodel\nR1 2 4 8000\nR2 4 3 120\n* Default values used in dmodel\n*   EG=1.11 TT=0 BV=infinite\n.MODEL dmodel d\n+IS=1e-12 RS=10 N=1 XTI=3\n+CJO=0 VJ=0.75 M=0.33 FC=0.5\n.MODEL qmodel pnp\n+IS=1.0012e-12 BF=116.055 NF=1.05819 VAF=92.7382\n+IKF=0.149857 ISE=1.24495e-12 NE=1.70621 BR=0.999735\n+NR=0.993731 VAR=100.194 IKR=0.0999992 ISC=1e-13\n+NC=2 RB=10.3948 IRB=0.200382 RBM=10.1772\n+RE=0.163782 RC=1.00023 XTB=0.505844 XTI=3.00058 EG=1.13482\n+CJE=1.53127e-10 VJE=0.95 MJE=0.469947 TF=1e-09\n+XTF=1 VTF=10 ITF=0.01 CJC=2.51701e-10\n+VJC=0.95 MJC=0.256722 XCJC=0.9 FC=0.5\n+TR=1e-07 PTF=0 KF=0 AF=1\n.MODEL q1model pnp\n+IS=1.0012e-12 BF=116.055 NF=1.05819 VAF=92.7382\n+IKF=0.149857 ISE=1.24495e-12 NE=1.70621 BR=0.999735\n+NR=0.993731 VAR=100.194 IKR=0.0999992 ISC=1e-13\n+NC=2 RB=10.3948 IRB=0.200382 RBM=10.1772\n+RE=0.163782 RC=1.00023 XTB=0.505844 XTI=3.00058 EG=1.13482\n+CJE=1.53127e-10 VJE=0.95 MJE=0.469947 TF=1e-09\n+XTF=1 VTF=10 ITF=0.01 CJC=0\n+VJC=0.95 MJC=0.256722 XCJC=0.9 FC=0.5\n+TR=1e-07 PTF=0 KF=0 AF=1\n.ENDS tip107\n\n\n*FQP17P06 60V P-CHANNEL DMOSFET ELECTRICAL PARAMETERS\n*------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n.SUBCKT  FQP17P06   20  10  30\nRg     10    1    1\nM1      2    1    3    3    DMOS    L=1u   W=1u\n.MODEL DMOS PMOS (VTO={-3.5*{-0.00034*TEMP+1.0085}} KP={9.3*{-0.000014*TEMP+1.00035}} \n+ THETA=0.056    VMAX=1.95E5   LEVEL=3)\nCgs 1   3   610P\nRd  20  4   42m     TC=0.0042\nDds 4   3   DDS\n.MODEL DDS D(BV={60*{0.0008*TEMP+0.98}}  M=0.5      CJO=235p   VJ=0.8)\nDbody   20  3   DBODY\n.MODEL DBODY D(IS=9.5E-13     N=1.0     RS=23.3m    EG=1.17    TT=92n)\nRa 4    2   31.3m   TC=0.0042\nRs 3    5   3.2m \nLs 5    30  1.0n\nM2 1    8   6    6   INTER\nE2 8    6   4    1   2\n.MODEL INTER PMOS (VTO=0   KP=10   LEVEL=1)\nCgdmax  7  4    950p\nRcgd    7  4    10meg\nDgd     4  6    DGD\nRdgd    4  6    10meg\n.MODEL DGD D(M=0.50   CJO=950p    VJ=0.52)\nM3      7  9  1  1  INTER\nE3      9  1  4  1  -2\n.ENDS FQP17P06\n*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n*FAIRCHILD      CASE: TO-220      PID: FQP17P06 \n*NOV-18-2000 CREATION    \n\n.simulator DEFAULT\n"
